  "_curation_note": "PQSigner semantic curation: all five displayed routes are admitted only for the direct Base mainnet AgentIdentityRegistry deployment below. At block 49227776 two independent RPCs returned the same runtime, which is byte-identical to the Base Blockscout-verified Solidity 0.8.33 deployment. Every signed operand is shown. Agent type and status codes use source-defined enum labels. A failed decision reduces reputation, and an incident also reduces reputation; either can suspend an active agent when its score crosses the source threshold. Registration starts the agent ACTIVE with reputation 750. Evidence is historical fixed-block source/runtime authority, not current owner/auditor authorization, agent state, execution success, future deployments, fallback, or blind signing. See tests/erc7730-semantic-evidence/corestake-sei-avvatar.",
